graph TD
    A[Bill Originates in House of Representatives<br>for Revenue Bills] --> B[Passed by House of Representatives]
    A2[Bill Originates in Senate<br>for Non-Revenue Bills] --> B2[Passed by Senate]
    B --> C{Passed by Both Houses?}
    B2 --> C
    C -- No --> D[Bill Fails]
    C -- Yes --> E[Presented to President]
    E --> F{President Approves?}
    F -- Yes --> G[President Signs Bill]
    G --> H[Becomes Law]
    F -- No --> I[President Returns Bill with Objections<br>to Originating House]
    I --> J[Originating House Reconsiders]
    J --> K{Two-thirds of Originating House<br>Agree to Pass?}
    K -- No --> D
    K -- Yes --> L[Sent to Other House with Objections]
    L --> M[Other House Reconsiders]
    M --> N{Two-thirds of Other House<br>Agree to Pass?}
    N -- No --> D
    N -- Yes --> H
    E --> O{President Does Not Return Bill<br>within 10 Days<br>Sundays excepted?}
    O -- Yes --> P{Congress Adjourned?}
    P -- No --> H
    P -- Yes --> D
    O -- No --> F
